&lt;h2 id="the-problem-with-traditional-cd"&gt;The Problem with Traditional cd&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you spend any significant time in the terminal, you know the pain of navigating deep directory structures. Even with the use of &lt;strong&gt;AI&lt;/strong&gt; today, at some point &lt;strong&gt;YOU&lt;/strong&gt; will need to access your directories quickly and intelligently.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>